      "chunk_index": 1,
      "heading": "Vision:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Vision:\nTo be recognized center of excellence in Mechanical Engineering education and research, producing competent, ethical, and socially responsible engineers who contribute to sustainable development and technological innovation.",
      "token_count": 33
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "heading": "Mission:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Mission:\nTo impart quality technical education in mechanical engineering through outcome-based curriculum, state-of-the-art laboratories, and modern pedagogical practices.\nTo promote innovation, entrepreneurship, and skill development in students by integrating interdisciplinary learning, hands-on training, and startup ecosystem exposure.\nTo enhance employability and global competence through industry-relevant training, internships, soft skills development, and exposure to emerging technologies such as AI and 3D printing.\nTo foster ethical values, social responsibility, and professional integrity in students, enabling them to serve society and contribute to national development.\nTo nurture sustainable engineering practices by focusing on energy efficiency, green technologies, and environmentally conscious design and manufacturing.\nHOD & BOS of",
      "token_count": 136
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_3",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "heading": "Mechanical Engineering",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Mechanical Engineering\nDr.Ch.Radhika\nHOD of Mechanical Department\n8686876092\nradhikareddy.chada@kakatiya.ac.in\nDepartment of Mechanical Engineering",
      "token_count": 25
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_4",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "heading": "Mechanical Engineering",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Mechanical Engineering\nis a versatile and foundational branch of engineering focused on the design, analysis, manufacturing, and maintenance of mechanical systems. It combines principles from physics, mathematics, and materials science to create and improve devices and processes that move, produce energy, or convert energy into motion. From tiny components to massive machines, mechanical engineering is essential to innovation and technological advancement across countless industries.",
      "token_count": 75
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_5",
      "chunk_index": 5,
      "heading": "Key areas within mechanical engineering include:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Key areas within mechanical engineering include:",
      "token_count": 7
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_6",
      "chunk_index": 6,
      "heading": "Thermodynamics and Heat Transfer:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Thermodynamics and Heat Transfer:\nThis area studies the principles of energy conversion and temperature regulation, critical in designing engines, power plants, heating, and cooling systems, and even sustainable energy solutions like solar power systems.",
      "token_count": 41
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_7",
      "chunk_index": 7,
      "heading": "Fluid Mechanics:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Fluid Mechanics:\nFluid mechanics is concerned with the behavior of fluids (liquids and gases) and their interactions with surfaces. Applications include everything from designing pumps and hydraulic systems to understanding aerodynamics in aircraft and cars.",
      "token_count": 40
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_8",
      "chunk_index": 8,
      "heading": "Mechanics and Materials Science:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Mechanics and Materials Science:\nMechanical engineers study materials to understand their strengths, weaknesses, and suitability for various applications. This field includes material selection, stress analysis, and ensuring safety in products and structures.",
      "token_count": 39
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_9",
      "chunk_index": 9,
      "heading": "Robotics and Automation:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Robotics and Automation:\nMechanical engineering plays a significant role in robotics, where engineers design, build, and program robots for use in manufacturing, healthcare, exploration, and more. Automation engineering focuses on developing systems to streamline production processes and improve efficiency.",
      "token_count": 48
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_10",
      "chunk_index": 10,
      "heading": "Manufacturing and Production:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Manufacturing and Production:\nThis area involves creating efficient processes for producing goods, from planning assembly lines to utilizing advanced manufacturing techniques like 3D printing. Mechanical engineers work to improve product quality while reducing costs and waste.",
      "token_count": 40
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "MECHANICAL-info.php.json_chunk_11",
      "chunk_index": 11,
      "heading": "Automotive and Aerospace Engineering:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Automotive and Aerospace Engineering:\nSpecializing in the design and production of vehicles, from cars to airplanes, mechanical engineers in this field focus on developing efficient, safe, and sustainable modes of transportation.\nFaculty",
      "token_count": 38
