      "heading": "Objectives:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Objectives:\nTo familiarize students with metal cutting operations and machining processes.\nTo impart skills in operating lathes, milling, drilling, shaping, grinding, and CNC machines.\nTo understand the principles of tool selection, cutting speed, feed, and depth of cut.",
      "token_count": 50
    },
    {
