      "heading": "Major Equipment Available:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Major Equipment Available:\nCentre Lathe Machines – For turning, facing, threading, knurling, and taper operations.\nShaper Machine – For flat surface generation.\nDrilling Machine – For precision hole-making.\nSurface Grinding Machine – For fine finishing and flat surface grinding.\nTool and Cutter Grinder",
      "token_count": 54
    },
