      "heading": "Learning Outcomes:",
      "heading_level": 2,
      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Learning Outcomes:\nUnderstand the working principles of various machine tools.\nGain proficiency in machining different materials using standard procedures.\nDevelop awareness of manufacturing tolerances, tool wear, and safety protocols.\nInterpret and apply technical drawings in workshop practices.",
      "token_count": 44
    },
